+{
+  "file": "src/agents.ts",
+  "snippet": "toolChoice: 'required',",
+  "cause": "The refundAgent is defined with toolChoice 'required', which forces the model to call a tool on every turn, so after the supervisor declines approveRefund it cannot produce a final text reply and instead re-calls tools until maxTurns (6) is exhausted.",
+  "evidence": "defineAgent passes toolChoice through the prompt render into generateStream on every agent turn (node_modules/@genkit-ai/ai/src/agent.ts ~L1507-1546, prompt.ts ~L330), and the triage agent in the same file already uses toolChoice 'auto'; with 'required' and no tool that ends the conversation, the decline path has no way to stop, matching the reported re-asking for approval, continued order work, and failures."
+}
